<section image-layout="blank" id="skplh5Epez"><grid spacing="none"><grid-item id="1Syg1uDiJJ"><p role="eyebrow"><span text-color="palette-2">Six-week pilot</span></p><h2>Prove the experience before scaling it</h2><grid marker="number" marker-rule="true" marker-position="above" marker-align="start" marker-numbering-format="decimal-leading-zero" vertical-sizing="hug" style="--marker-gap: 0.6em;"><grid-item id="x8ZcCTRTGE" colspan="20"><h4>Weeks 1&#x2013;2 &#xb7; Prepare</h4><p font-size="16pt">Verify practitioner credentials and local requirements; choose the ritual and room; test booking handoff.</p></grid-item><grid-item id="xZC50Lr3zE" colspan="20"><h4>Weeks 3&#x2013;6 &#xb7; Operate</h4><p font-size="16pt">Run the agreed calendar, review attendance and issues weekly, and collect one short guest rating.</p></grid-item><grid-item id="-z7ac5YEsY" colspan="20"><h4>End of week 6 &#xb7; Decide</h4><p font-size="16pt">Continue, adapt, or stop using evidence from guests, staff, safety, and the commercial model.</p></grid-item></grid><grid spacing="medium" vertical-sizing="hug"><grid-item id="qQUiQ9Ycq_" colspan="44"><h3>Agree illustrative decision gates before launch</h3><table col-widths="[25,25,30,20]" header-row="true" borders="rows" striped="false" style="--table-cell-padding: 5pt 8pt;"><tbody><tr><td><p>Measure</p></td><td><p>Gate</p></td><td><p>Measure</p></td><td><p>Gate</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Seat fill</p></td><td><p><b>At least 40%</b></p></td><td><p>No-show rate</p></td><td><p><b>15% or below</b></p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Guest rating</p></td><td><p><b>At least 4.5/5</b></p></td><td><p>Safety/service issues</p></td><td><p><b>None unresolved</b></p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Incremental administration</p></td><td><p><b>Within agreed limit</b></p></td><td><p>Contribution after direct costs</p></td><td><p><b>Positive</b></p></td></tr></tbody></table></grid-item><grid-item id="29qhi1I0cW" colspan="16"><grid spacing="none" vertical-sizing="hug"><grid-item background-color="surface" padding="12pt"><p font-size="15pt">The 40% fill gate exceeds the illustrative 36% direct-cost break-even, but it is not a total-profitability test. Excluded: hotel labor, room opportunity cost, fees, taxes, and capital expenditure.</p></grid-item></grid></grid-item></grid></grid-item></grid></section>